        "collapsible_tab_UWQ8gk": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Overview",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Overview",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>The Yarbo Snow Blower Module attaches to your Yarbo Core and turns it into a fully autonomous winter clearing machine. No shoveling, no scheduling a plow, no early mornings.</p><p><strong>Two-Stage Clearing</strong><br/>24\" clearing width, 12\" intake height, and up to 40 feet of throw distance handles dry, wet, and packed snow. Chute rotates -10° to 190° and deflector adjusts from -5° to 50° so you control exactly where snow lands.</p><p><strong>Clears Automatically</strong><br/>It monitors weather conditions and starts clearing on its own when snowfall begins, working continuously through the storm to prevent buildup. Auto-docks at 20% battery and resumes clearing at 80%, with zero input from you.</p><p><strong>Built for Real Winter</strong><br/>Q355 steel construction, an IPX5 waterproof rating, and a standard operating range of -13°F to 113°F (-25°C to 45°C). Works on asphalt, cement, masonry, gravel, and tile.</p><p><strong>Smart Zone Mapping</strong><br/>Map your driveway, pathways, and sidewalks separately in the Yarbo App. Each zone gets its own route, deflector angle, and schedule. Spiral Mode supports circular driveways.</p><p><strong>Coverage</strong><br/>Approximately 6,000 ft² per charge (Y40), charging in about 1.5 hours. Free shipping and backed by Yarbo's 2-year manufacturer warranty.</p><p>Requires Yarbo Core, Smart Battery, and docking station — sold separately or as part of a bundle.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Uf69Wz": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Product Information",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Product Information",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>The Autonomous Estate. By Yard Automation Pros.</strong></p><p><strong>Winter clearing, zero effort.</strong></p><p>The Snow Blower module attaches to your Yarbo Core and turns it into a two-stage winter machine built for driveways, walkways, and mixed surfaces, fully autonomous, every storm.</p><p><strong>Requires a Yarbo Core to run.</strong> This module needs a Core base to operate. If you don’t already own one, a bundle like the <a href=\"/products/yarbo-lawn-mower-pro-core-lawn-mower-pro-module\">Lawn Mower Pro bundle</a> includes a Core and gets you running immediately.</p><h3>Two-stage clearing, not a single push</h3><p>An auger pulls snow in and a second-stage impeller throws it clear, the same two-stage principle used on commercial equipment, so it handles dry, wet, and packed snow without clogging.</p><h3>Works with the Core’s all-terrain chassis</h3><p>The module relies on the Core’s tracked, steel-spiked drive system for traction on packed snow and ice that leaves wheeled machines spinning in place.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_X7L37G": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Warranty & Support",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Warranty & Support:",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Covered by Yarbo’s standard 2 year manufacturer warranty on defective parts, excluding consumables, beginning from the date your machine is activated. We reply to emails within 1 business day at support@yardautomationpros.com.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HjeTwa": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Setup & Installation",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Setup & Installation",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Attaching the Snow Blower module to your Yarbo Core takes just a few minutes, no tools required. The Yarbo app guides you through calibration and setup. Compatible with iOS and Android.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_czbJiW": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Specifications",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Specifications",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>Snow Blower Module</strong><br/>Stage type: 2-stage design<br/>Clearing width: 24 inches<br/>Intake height: 12 inches (raises up to ~2 inches to skim uneven gravel)<br/>Throw distance: 6 to 40 feet (adjustable)<br/>Chute rotation: -10° to 190°<br/>Deflector angle: -5° to 50°<br/>Applicable snow types: dry, wet, packed snow<br/>Coverage per charge: approximately 6,000 ft² (Y40)<br/>Charging time: approximately 1.5 hours<br/>Max climbing ability (module attached): 36% (20°)<br/>Operating temperature: -13°F to 113°F (-25°C to 45°C)<br/>Construction: Q355 steel, IPX5 waterproof rating<br/>Surfaces: asphalt, cement, masonry, gravel, tile<br/>Optional accessory: plow blade attachment for wet, heavy snow (sold separately)</p><p><strong>Yarbo Core</strong><br/>Navigation: RTK + Vision + IMU + ODOM<br/>Obstacle avoidance: Binocular camera + ultrasonic radar + bumper<br/>Drive system: Tracked with steel-spiked traction<br/>Battery capacity: 38.4 Ah<br/>Auto-dock: Yes — docks at 20%, resumes at 80%<br/>Connectivity: 4G, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi HaLow<br/>Warranty: Covered by Yarbo's standard 2-year manufacturer warranty on defective parts, excluding consumables, from the date of activation (3-year extended warranty available as an add-on)<br/>Delivery: approximately 10 to 14 days after payment</p>"
          }
        },
