        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .sb-stack { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 24px; text-align: center; }\n  .sb-stack__frame { border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(35,39,57,.10); background: #fff; margin: 0 0 28px; }\n  .sb-stack__frame img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 420px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .sb-stack__kicker { display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #c9a84c; margin: 0 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid #c9a84c; }\n  .sb-stack__heading { font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px); font-weight: 700; color: #233923; margin: 0 0 16px; line-height: 1.2; }\n  .sb-stack__text { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #233923; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 560px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"sb-stack\">\n  <div class=\"sb-stack__frame\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0965/2056/9136/files/Yarbo_S1_1.png?v=1787782890\" alt=\"Yarbo Core and Snow Blower Module shown separately, ready to attach\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\">\n  </div>\n  <h2 class=\"sb-stack__heading\">Attaches to the Core You Already Own</h2>\n  <p class=\"sb-stack__text\">The Snow Blower Module is the winter half of the same modular system as the Lawn Mower Pro and Leaf Blower. It mounts to the Yarbo Core's tracked chassis and comes back off in minutes when the season changes, one Core, swapped through all four seasons.</p>\n</div>"
